      "writtenOn": "2025-06-23T20:55:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we can use this Device\u0027s DrawContext as the container for the copy tasks. The container needs to be the consumer of the copy, whereas this is the source of the copy.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 584,
        "startChar": 0,
